  "worked_solution": "The elements of $A$ are all the terms of the sequence ${a}_{n},$ given by\n\n$$\n{a}_{n}={3}^{n},\\,n\\in N.\n$$\n\nLet's write down the first few terms of our sequence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & ={3}^{1}=3 \\\\ {a}_{2} & ={3}^{2}=9 \\\\ {a}_{3} & ={3}^{3}=27 \\\\ {a}_{4} & ={3}^{4}=81 \\\\  & \u22ee\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nA={3,9,27,81,\u2026}.\n$$",
